&lt;p style="line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;（2）重要な関連会社の要約財務情報&lt;/p&gt;
