&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 66px; text-align: left"&gt;（3）譲渡先の企業名称&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;茂名華彩油墨有限公司&lt;/p&gt;
